'''Goddess of Abundance - Freya''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.4 Update|Version 4.4]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Yurudrasil Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 235
|rarity = SR
|name1 = Goddess of Abundance - Freya
|name2 = Goddess of Abundance - Freya CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Goddess of Abundance - Freya CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Being a Super Rare crowd-controller with unusually long range may sound interesting at first, but in actuality, Freya has issues that drag her down. One is her poor total uptime, only worked around by stacking many of her at once over a lengthy period of time. Curiously, her abysmally low DPS can come into play, letting her stack up on a bulky enemy and hardly making a dent in its health. Another issue is her target types; Dark enemies are already countered by [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] and even [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]]'s [[Slow|Slow]] [[Talents|Talent]], and Angels are countered by [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] most of the time, though, rarely, being able to outrange [[Angelic Sleipnir]] can have its perks. If long-ranged crowd-control support is needed and can be stacked, [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]] is and has always been the best option.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & Backliner}}

